    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Feedback Pipeline\n\nOwned By: Your Name\nLast Updated: Date\n\nFetches customer feedback from the Academy API, classifies it\nusing structured output, and generates a tailored reply.\n\n## Flow\n1. GetFeedback: Fetches feedback items from Academy endpoint\n2. SetFeedbackItem: Limits to first item for processing\n3. GenerateReply: AI generates initial response\n4. ClassifyFeedback: AI classifies sentiment, topic, urgency\n5. SetClassificationResult: Extracts parsed classification\n6. GenerateReply (updated): Produces classification-aware reply\n7. SendGeneratedReply: Posts result to Academy for grading\n\n## Model\n- OpenRouter\n\n## Dependencies\n- Requires: n8n Academy API Key credential, OpenRouter API credential\n\nPart of: n8n Foundations Course, Section 4",
        "height": 512,
        "width": 560
      },
